From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] nftables: retain native IPv6 pinhole rule identity

Refresh live kernel state and allocate unused pinhole IDs. Preserve ingress
identity, protocol, counters and acknowledged replacement by handle, including
IPv6 extension headers and missing-rule versus backend errors.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
